WEBVTT

00:24:29.904 --> 00:24:32.004
and so it's really hard to know

00:24:32.028 --> 00:24:34.387
what his individual contribution is.

00:24:34.411 --> 00:24:38.471
I feel like I see far more individuals
who aren't using models

00:24:38.495 --> 00:24:41.592
make mistakes about what
the individual contributions are,

00:24:41.616 --> 00:24:44.025
than I do see models make that mistake.

00:24:44.388 --> 00:24:46.337
AG: I had an organization I was studying

00:24:46.361 --> 00:24:48.424
where one of the leaders
came back and said,

00:24:48.448 --> 00:24:52.197
"Well, you know, we had a guy
who likes to throw staplers at people."

00:24:52.221 --> 00:24:55.253
And you know, you hear that and you think,

00:24:55.277 --> 00:24:58.845
"Okay, how in the world is an algorithm
going to pick up on that?"

00:24:58.869 --> 00:25:00.250
CM: It's a known problem.